# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID for the NAOMI subsite. This is a SEPARATE
# GA4 property from the main site (jasonduffett.net) and from Clara's subsite,
# so the three traffic streams stay distinct. When set at build time the GA4 tag
# and cookie consent banner are emitted into the layout. Leave unset for local
# dev or to disable analytics.
NAOMI_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
